@startuml
title CaseflowAI - Dispute Processing Orchestration (Prototype)

autonumber stop
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF6A8
skinparam NoteBorderColor #A88200

box "Channels" #F5EEF0
actor "Card Holder" as CardHolder
participant "CDMS" as CDMS
end box

box "Engine" #EFF4FA
participant "CaseController" as CaseController
participant "DisputeProcessingService" as DisputeProcessingService
participant "SupervisorAgent" as SupervisorAgent
participant "DisputeIntakeAgent" as DisputeIntakeAgent
participant "DisputeTriageAgent" as DisputeTriageAgent
participant "EvidenceHunterAgent" as EvidenceHunterAgent
participant "FraudInvestigationAgent" as FraudInvestigationAgent
end box

database "CaseDB" as CaseDB

box "External Systems" #E8F5E9
participant "Mastercard RAG" as MastercardRAG
participant "PowerCARD" as PowerCARD
participant "SICS" as SICS
participant "Shipping Tracker" as ShippingTracker
participant "Fraud Management" as FraudManagement
end box

== Case Creation (fast, synchronous) ==

CardHolder -> CDMS: Submit Dispute
CDMS -> CaseController: POST /engine/v1/case/create
CaseController -> CaseDB: Save Case (status=PENDING)
CaseDB --> CaseController: CaseId
CaseController --> CDMS: 202 Accepted (caseId)

note right of CaseController
Agents are NOT run on the request
thread - reasoning can take minutes.
end note

CaseController -> DisputeProcessingService: Process(caseId) <<async>>

== Agent Orchestration ==

DisputeProcessingService -> CaseDB: Update Case (status=PROCESSING)
DisputeProcessingService -> SupervisorAgent: Start(caseId)

par Phase 1 - Independent Agents [run in parallel]
    group Intake Processing
        SupervisorAgent -> DisputeIntakeAgent: Process(caseId)
        DisputeIntakeAgent -> CaseDB: Get Case + Attachments(caseId)
        CaseDB --> DisputeIntakeAgent: Case Data
        DisputeIntakeAgent -> DisputeIntakeAgent: Validate Evidence\n(reasoning model)
        note right of DisputeIntakeAgent
        - Pixel-level tampering detection
        - Field extraction
        end note
        DisputeIntakeAgent -> CaseDB: Save DocValidationScore\n+ ExtractedFields(JSON)
        DisputeIntakeAgent --> SupervisorAgent: IntakeCompleted
    end

else Dispute Triage
    SupervisorAgent -> DisputeTriageAgent: Process(caseId)
    DisputeTriageAgent -> CaseDB: Get Case Details(caseId)
    CaseDB --> DisputeTriageAgent: Transaction Data
    DisputeTriageAgent -> MastercardRAG: Search Mastercard Rules
    MastercardRAG --> DisputeTriageAgent: Applicable Rules
    DisputeTriageAgent -> DisputeTriageAgent: Determine Dispute Category\n(reasoning model)
    note right of DisputeTriageAgent
    - Dispute Category + Code
    - Eligibility
    - Required Evidence
    end note
    DisputeTriageAgent -> CaseDB: Save Triage Result
    DisputeTriageAgent --> SupervisorAgent: TriageCompleted(requiredEvidence)
end

par Phase 2 - Needs Triage Result [run in parallel]
    group Evidence Gathering
        SupervisorAgent -> EvidenceHunterAgent: Process(caseId, requiredEvidence)
        EvidenceHunterAgent -> CaseDB: Get Case + Triage Result(caseId)
        CaseDB --> EvidenceHunterAgent: Case Data + Required Evidence
        
        alt Acquiring Dispute
            EvidenceHunterAgent -> PowerCARD: Get Transaction Details
            PowerCARD --> EvidenceHunterAgent: Transaction Data
        else Issuing Dispute
            EvidenceHunterAgent -> SICS: Get Transaction Details
            SICS --> EvidenceHunterAgent: Transaction Data
        end
        
        opt Shipping Information Required
            EvidenceHunterAgent -> ShippingTracker: Query Shipment
            ShippingTracker --> EvidenceHunterAgent: Delivery Status
        end
        
        EvidenceHunterAgent -> CaseDB: Save Evidence Details
        EvidenceHunterAgent --> SupervisorAgent: EvidenceCompleted
    end

else Fraud Investigation
    SupervisorAgent -> FraudInvestigationAgent: Process(caseId)
    FraudInvestigationAgent -> CaseDB: Get Transaction Details(caseId)
    CaseDB --> FraudInvestigationAgent: Transaction Data
    FraudInvestigationAgent -> FraudManagement: Fraud Assessment
    FraudManagement --> FraudInvestigationAgent: FraudScore + FraudRemarks
    FraudInvestigationAgent -> CaseDB: Save Fraud Findings
    FraudInvestigationAgent --> SupervisorAgent: FraudCompleted
end

== Consolidation ==

alt All agents completed
    SupervisorAgent -> CaseDB: Retrieve Agent Results
    CaseDB --> SupervisorAgent: Intake + Triage + Evidence + Fraud Results
    SupervisorAgent -> SupervisorAgent: Build consolidated\ndispute assessment
    SupervisorAgent -> CaseDB: Save Investigation Summary
    SupervisorAgent -> CaseDB: Update Case (status=ASSESSED)
    SupervisorAgent --> DisputeProcessingService: ProcessingCompleted

else Any agent failed or timed out
    SupervisorAgent -> CaseDB: Update Case (status=FAILED)
    SupervisorAgent --> DisputeProcessingService: ProcessingFailed(reason)
    
    note over SupervisorAgent, CaseDB
    Prototype: no checkpoint, no resume.
    Re-running the case starts the whole
    orchestration from the beginning.
    end note
end

CDMS -> CaseController: GET /engine/v1/case/{caseId}
CaseController -> DisputeProcessingService: Get Case Status + Summary
DisputeProcessingService --> CaseController: Status = Assessment
CaseController --> CDMS: Case Result
CDMS -> CardHolder: Outcome notification

@enduml
